                                                "sense_id": "e943c4f1-26a2-3eab-8a52-7feb2f87b5f6",
                                                "text": "\"Yes,\" she said, \"the husband is pretty ex.\" And then, for no reason at all, she added: \"His name is Norman.\"\nBill nodded solemnly. \"I see why you left him.\"\nRosie began to giggle and clapped her hands to her mouth."
                                            }
